						"value": "WRITE\n\nThe Write node can be used to overwrite existing values in a collection.\nThe main inlet should be the collection you want to (partially) overwrite.\nThe index inlet is the position(s) that you want to overwrite.\nThe value inlet is the value you want to overwrite on the given index."
