						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE: OVERWRITING A LINEAR\n\nIn this example we have 25 Rectangles in a Grid Pattern.\nWe color them using the Shape Render node.\nThe Linear node generates a collection of 25 colors.\nNext, we Write the white color to the collection.\nThe index is modulated by a Saw node running from 0 to 25.\n\nNow we have a white rectangle moving along the grid."
